      "id": "claim_fe0027fec0694e599bdfb93e04648b41",
      "statement": "Each hx-doc tool is a pair of an extensionless bash wrapper and a Python body beside it, and the wrapper probes candidate interpreters for one that actually reports Python 3 rather than assuming python3 is an interpreter, because on Windows a python3 App Execution Alias sits on PATH and is not one.",
