      "statement": "hx-doc-check verifies that a runbook block only tells the operator to check a systemd unit the block itself creates, stripping comment lines first so that a mention in a comment or an rm cannot satisfy the check, and requiring a real creation via the unit helper or a tee, cp, install or redirect to the unit path.",
